### Create employee
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Kowalski",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-15",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "socialSecurityNumber": "123-45-6789"
}

### Get employee by id (podmień {id} na wartość z odpowiedzi powyżej)
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/fa668b14-33d1-4983-9716-6bc33910db31

### List employees
GET http://localhost:8080/employees

### Duplicate SSN - powinno zwrócić 409
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "lastName": "Nowak",
  "dateOfBirth": "1985-03-20",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "socialSecurityNumber": "123-45-6789"
}

### Invalid input - brak wymaganych pól, powinno zwrócić 400
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": ""
}

### Not found - losowe UUID, powinno zwrócić 404
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000